WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.367
Ashoka's Kalinga war killed and

2
00:00:02.367 --> 00:00:04.383
displaced many thousands.

3
00:00:04.383 --> 00:00:05.819
His own edict says he

4
00:00:05.819 --> 00:00:07.223
regretted it.

5
00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:10.874
Chandragupta Maurya came to power

6
00:00:10.874 --> 00:00:12.722
around 321 BCE.

7
00:00:12.722 --> 00:00:16.308
Ashoka fought Kalinga around 261

8
00:00:16.308 --> 00:00:17.327
BCE.

9
00:00:17.663 --> 00:00:19.445
In Rock Edict thirteen,

10
00:00:19.445 --> 00:00:21.664
Ashoka records his remorse.

11
00:00:21.664 --> 00:00:22.441
After that,

12
00:00:22.441 --> 00:00:24.262
he spread dhamma: tolerance,

13
00:00:24.262 --> 00:00:26.423
non-violence, care for all.

14
00:00:27.092 --> 00:00:30.148
Other sources: Kautilya's Arthashastra,

15
00:00:30.148 --> 00:00:32.535
and Megasthenes's Indica.

16
00:00:32.878 --> 00:00:34.149
Your turn.

17
00:00:34.149 --> 00:00:35.781
Which edict?
